    "objective": "Draft H-ICEX-6ca21f (parent H-ICEX-d8e858) and the frozen-ready contract EXP-ICEX-153c34: measure Groebner or summation-polynomial m = 5 factor-base membership cost per success on the six EXP-ICEX-aaccfc v4 fixtures, holding fixtures, B rule, C-3 units, collector, linear algebra, descents and matched rho fixed; primary comparison against the EV-ICEX-16e3ec obstruction (50-306 rho solves per success) and the sqrt(q)/(L+27) units-per-success competitiveness threshold; reuse and cite EXP-ICEX-fa2b37 backend design where applicable. Any exponent claim must remove L variance from the slope (frozen L series or a fit conditioned on ln L), use at least three field sizes and a within-size bootstrap.",
